{"unit_id":"tag:023F:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，对一个<MATH_0001>-模（module）<MATH_0002>，我们可以赋予一个典范（canonical）的下降（descent）数据（datum），即<MATH_0003>，其中<MATH_0004>是显然的映射（map）：<MATH_0005>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"环上的模。"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范","context":"由模给出的典范构造。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"模的下降数据。"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据","context":"单个下降数据。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"给定的典范映射。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:023I:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个环映射（ring map）。设<MATH_0002>是一个<MATH_0003>-模（module）。与典范（canonical）下降（descent）数据（datum）相联系的余单纯（cosimplicial）<MATH_0004>-模（module）同构于（isomorphic）余单纯（cosimplicial）模（module）<MATH_0005>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构于"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射","context":"环之间的映射。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"环及余单纯环上的模。"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范","context":"典范下降数据。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"模的下降。"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据","context":"单个下降数据。"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯","context":"余单纯模。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构于","context":"余单纯模之间的同构关系。"}],"notes":[]}
