{"unit_id":"tag:023J:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个环映射（ring map）。我们说下降（descent）数据（datum）<MATH_0002>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>有效（effective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，是指存在一个<MATH_0003>-模（module）<MATH_0004>，以及一个下降（descent）数据（data）的同构（isomorphism），从<MATH_0005>到<MATH_0006>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"data","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射","context":"下降所针对的环映射。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"模的下降数据。"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据","context":"单个下降数据。"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效","context":"由某个底环模诱导的下降数据。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"底环上的模。"},{"source_term":"data","target_term":"数据","context":"下降数据之间的同构。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"指定方向的下降数据同构。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:023F:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是一个环映射（ring map）。设<MATH_0002>是一个下降（descent）数据（datum）。我们可以取与<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>有关的上链（cochain）复形（complex），其中前者是与后者相联系的复形（complex）（见 Simplicial，第<REF_0001>节）。它具有如下形状：<MATH_0005>我们可以描述这些映射（maps）。第一个映射（map）是映射（map）<MATH_0006>第二个映射（map）在纯张量（pure tensors）上的值为<MATH_0007>。这一模式如何继续是清楚的。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n在<MATH_0008>的特殊情形下，我们看到，对任意<MATH_0009>，元素（element）<MATH_0010>属于与余单纯（cosimplicial）模（module）<MATH_0011>相联系的上链（cochain）复形（complex）的第一个映射（map）的核（kernel）。因此，我们得到一个扩充的上链（cochain）复形（complex）<MATH_0012>这里，我们把<MATH_0013>看成处于度（degree）<MATH_0014>，模（module）<MATH_0015>处于度（degree）<MATH_0016>，模（module）<MATH_0017>处于度（degree）<MATH_0018>，等等。注意，这个复形（complex）具有形状<MATH_0019>，当<MATH_0020>时。\n\n","allowed_english":["Simplicial"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"cochain","target_term":"上链"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"pure tensors","target_term":"纯张量"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"cochain","target_term":"上链"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"cochain","target_term":"上链"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"度"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"度"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"度"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射","context":"给定环映射。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"由下降数据构造复形。"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据","context":"单个下降数据。"},{"source_term":"cochain","target_term":"上链","context":"上链复形。"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"余单纯模的相伴及扩充复形。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"复形中的各映射。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"复形的微分映射。"},{"source_term":"pure tensors","target_term":"纯张量","context":"张量积中的纯张量。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"模中的元素。"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯","context":"与复形相联系的余单纯模。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"复形的各项。"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核","context":"第一个映射的核。"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"度","context":"上链复形的分次度。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:023L:statement","translation":"假设<MATH_0001>有一个截面（section）。那么，对任意<MATH_0002>-模（module）<MATH_0003>，扩充的上链（cochain）复形（complex）（<REF_0001>）是正合（exact）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"cochain","target_term":"上链"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面","context":"环映射的截面。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"底环上的模。"},{"source_term":"cochain","target_term":"上链","context":"扩充上链复形。"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"由典范下降数据给出的扩充复形。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"该复形的正合性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:023L:proof","translation":"由 Simplicial，引理<REF_0001>，映射（map）<MATH_0001>是余单纯（cosimplicial）<MATH_0002>-代数（algebras）的同伦等价（homotopy equivalence）（这里，<MATH_0003>表示常值（constant）余单纯（cosimplicial）<MATH_0004>-代数（algebra））。因此，<MATH_0005>是余单纯（cosimplicial）<MATH_0006>-模（modules）的范畴（category）中的同伦等价（homotopy equivalence），因为<MATH_0007>是从<MATH_0008>-代数（algebras）的范畴（category）到<MATH_0009>-模（modules）的范畴（category）的一个函子（functor），见 Simplicial，引理<REF_0002>。这表明，相伴复形（complexes）的诱导映射（induced map）是一个同伦等价（homotopy equivalence），见 Simplicial，引理<REF_0003>。由于与常值（constant）余单纯（cosimplicial）<MATH_0010>-模（module）<MATH_0011>相联系的复形（complex）是复形（complex）<MATH_0012>，我们便得到所需结论（因为扩充版本只是在开头额外放入一个<MATH_0013>）。\n","allowed_english":["Simplicial"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"homotopy equivalence","target_term":"同伦等价"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"homotopy equivalence","target_term":"同伦等价"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"induced map","target_term":"诱导映射"},{"source_term":"homotopy equivalence","target_term":"同伦等价"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"余单纯代数之间的映射。"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯","context":"余单纯代数和余单纯模。"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数","context":"底环代数的范畴。"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"常值余单纯代数。"},{"source_term":"homotopy equivalence","target_term":"同伦等价","context":"余单纯对象及相伴复形的同伦等价。"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值","context":"常值余单纯对象。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"余单纯模的范畴。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"代数和模的范畴。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"张量积给出的函子。"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"相伴上链复形。"},{"source_term":"induced map","target_term":"诱导映射","context":"相伴复形之间的诱导映射。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"常值余单纯模。"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"常值对象的相伴复形。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:023M:statement","translation":"假设<MATH_0001>是忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的，见《代数》（Algebra），定义<REF_0001>。那么，对任意<MATH_0002>-模（module）<MATH_0003>，扩充的上链（cochain）复形（complex）（<REF_0002>）是正合（exact）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"cochain","target_term":"上链"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦","context":"环映射的忠实平坦性。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"所引用的代数章。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"底环上的模。"},{"source_term":"cochain","target_term":"上链","context":"扩充上链复形。"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"由典范下降数据给出的复形。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"扩充复形的正合性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:023M:proof","translation":"假设我们能证明，存在一个忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的环映射（ring map）<MATH_0001>，使得结论对于环映射（ring map）<MATH_0002>成立。那么，结论对于<MATH_0003>也成立。具体地，对任意<MATH_0004>-模（module）<MATH_0005>，余单纯（cosimplicial）模（module）<MATH_0006>正是余单纯（cosimplicial）模（module）<MATH_0007>。因此，与<MATH_0008>相联系的复形（complex）的上同调（cohomology）的消失（vanishing），由<MATH_0009>以及<MATH_0010>之间的忠实（faithful）的平坦性（flatness）可推出前者所对应的上同调（cohomology）的消失（vanishing）。对于扩充复形（complex）的度（degrees）<MATH_0011>和<MATH_0012>中的上同调群（cohomology groups）的消失（vanishing），情形类似（证明省略）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n但我们确实有这样的忠实（faithful）的平坦（flat）扩张（extension）。具体地，<MATH_0013>可用，因为环映射（ring map）<MATH_0014>有截面（section）<MATH_0015>，并且引理<REF_0001>适用。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"faithful","target_term":"忠实"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"degrees","target_term":"度"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"faithful","target_term":"忠实"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦","context":"底环的忠实平坦变换。"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":